    (x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x20 x21 x22 x23 x24 x25 x30 x31 x32 x33 x34 x35 x40 x41 x42 x43 x44 x45 x50 x51 x52 x53 x54 x55 x60 x61 x62 x63 x64 x65 : ℝ)
    (h0 : y0 + x10 + x20 + x30 + x40 + x50 + x60 = D * r0 / 2)
    (h1 : y1 + x11 + x21 + x31 + x41 + x51 + x61 = D * r1 / 2)
